('old city tour + nizami street',NULL,'Hotel','Hotel','30',30,'PrivateTransfer',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Old City tour starts from Shamakhi Gates followed by Old city below places (Photo stop)  -Shamakhi Gates  -Sculptures of Azim Azimzadeh’s  -Caravanserai of Bukhara  -Caravanserai of Multani  -Maiden’s Tower  -Bazar Square  -Miniature Books’ Museum  -Shirvanshahs’ Palace + Nizami Street in Baku is an absolute must-visit! The vibrant atmosphere, beautifully lit streets, and a mix of modern and historic architecture create an unforgettable experience. It’s perfect for a leisurely stroll, shopping at high-end boutiques, or enjoying a meal at one of the many cafes and restaurants. The street truly comes alive in the evening, with its lively vibe and gorgeous lighting. Whether you’re a tourist or a local, Nizami Street offers something for everyone.',NULL,NULL,'Sedan - 4 Seaters (Local Speaking)',30.0),
